<title>NETHERLANDS: Nedlloyd soars on P&amp;O container merger.</title>
<headline>Nedlloyd soars on P&amp;O container merger.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch shipping and road transport group Nedlloyd NV rose by over 11 percent after it announced plans to merge its container shipping business with P&amp;O.</p>
<p>Nedlloyd shares were up 4.40 guilders at 43.90 guilders at 0750 GMT in a marginally firmer market.</p>
<p>The joint company will be one of the largest in world container shipping, Nedlloyd said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Strategically that could be a good move,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
